WEBVTT

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.350
Otoya-san!

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.320
Airin-kun...

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.900
I've already decided that...

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:07.120
When I fall, it will be into the arms of the man I love.

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.530
Otoya-san!

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.460
It's Kizaki...

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:29.670
Shake! The Strongest Akikan

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.260
It's terrible, it's just terrible!

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.080
I heard that Airin-sensei was hospitalized with a serious injury!

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.700
Ehhhh?!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.340
What the hell did you say?!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.000
Airin-chan's...

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.570
Nipples...

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.250
Note: This is a pun on the Japanese word "nyuuin", which means "to be hospitalized."

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:46.490
Whoa, ow, ow!

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.660
Apologize to all the women in the room!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.020
So then, what was the cause of the injury?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.700
I've heard that none of the other teachers know the exact details.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.710
But to think that Airin-chan's been hospitalized...

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.410
Should we go pay her a visit?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.310
You must be joking!

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.040
Why would I, for someone like that?

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:15.990
Um... Melon-san?

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.420
Who... are you?

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:24.430
I... I...

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.120
Eh? Wait, why all of a sudden...?

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.150
What the hell did you do?

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.230
Ah, how sad!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.690
If you're going to cry, my arms are...

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.650
Have you calmed down a bit?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.980
Then, why don't you tell us already?

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:49.100
About Melon's wrongdoing that caused you to--

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.720
I told you I didn't do anything!

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:52.930
Was it really nothing?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.210
But she said that she always went to your place...

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.130
Who are you talking about?

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.310
Budoko!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.190
Budoko?

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:05.990
My one and only friend...

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:11.110
Thank goodness, we made it just in time for the sale!

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:11.890
It seems so!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.780
I wonder if it's thanks to this present you gave me?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.440
Not at all... I was just trying to...

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.720
Okay! Let's hurry home and have dinner!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.130
Sure!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.340
I'll do my best with cooking today!

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.850
I'm looking forward to it!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:38.200
Then you're Budoko's owner...?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.320
Misaki-chan?

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.170
Yes.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.840
Budoko hasn't come back since yesterday,

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.320
and I found this in the park where we usually play together.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.590
I'm worried that something might have happened to her...

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.380
Hey, Melon!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.370
I don't know anything!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.620
I really don't, okay?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.020
I tried to tell her that the Akikan Elect was no good for her.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.290
But...

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:11.910
No matter how many times I say it...

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:15.280
Hey! What's the matter?

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.210
A love triangle?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.810
An issue of unrequited love?

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.120
That's right!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.790
Misaki-chan has no interest in my charms.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.620
You sure are a sinner, Kerukeru!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.570
And which one do you prefer?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.370
Well, the answer is, of course, the young and fresh Misaki-chan—

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.820
Oh my!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.050
Budoko, where did you go?

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:42.120
Budoko...

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:51.100
It's a full course meal prepared using the ingredients we purchased at the sale.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.330
I've even used the skin, stems, and fat abundantly.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.240
You're amazing as always, Yell!

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:00.690
The Ghost of Wastefulness will surely not come, right?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.830
Itadakimasu!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.460
It's yummy, Yell!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.350
Sorry, Owner.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.140
I have something I need to do.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.020
Something you need to do?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:22.740
Come out here!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.880
I know you're out there!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.410
Thank you very much for your help.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.610
Will you be okay?

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:37.770
Won't you be scolded by your parents for going home this late?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:38.850
It's no problem.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:41.360
Both of my parents are always working late.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:44.260
That's why I was always lonely.

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.040
But then Budoko came...

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.880
Just because Budoko was there...

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.760
Mi-sa-ki!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.350
I was so happy.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.110
Misaki! I love you!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.080
Budoko...

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.750
What are your intentions?

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:44.990
I can't lose.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.200
Owner's waiting for—

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.170
What was that just now?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.730
Don't tell me something happened to—

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.170
Owner...

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.230
Yell!

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.870
Owner...

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:16.710
I'm happy to have met you...

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:30.950
Yell...

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.120
Yell!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.890
No!

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.640
Budoko...

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.140
I can see her owner truly loved her.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.610
Oh? Should I give you some loving too?

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.450
You already know how I feel!

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.580
Even I... um...

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.970
So we need to look for her, huh?

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:34.970
For Budoko.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.120
Yeah.

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.030
Hello?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:43.570
Huh?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:44.920
The hospital?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:50.600
Najimi!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.040
Kakeru-chan?

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.990
What in the world happened?!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.690
Where's Yell?

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.040
Where is Yell, anyway?

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.200
Yell...

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.970
Yell is...

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.680
Hey, Najimi.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.560
Don't tell me something happened to Yell—

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:14.050
That's correct.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.050
Airin!

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:18.900
It's Kizaki.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.140
Those girls were attacked.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.970
By that abomination.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.320
Abomination?

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:30.440
W-What the heck is that?

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.170
The ultimate Akikan.

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:36.730
Huh?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.200
The ultimate Akikan?

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.820
Wait, hold on a minute!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:44.040
Does that mean that I'm not the only steel can that fought with Yell?

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:44.970
No.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.510
It doesn't matter to her whether they're steel or not.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:52.070
All the Akikan are targets to her.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:54.990
Then Yell was done in by that Akikan?

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:56.390
Most likely...

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:58.420
What the hell is that?

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.260
What the hell is she thinking?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.730
That's not something I know.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:07.320
She came from West Area, an area outside of our jurisdiction.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:12.760
We do not know any of her abilities, goals, or other details.

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:15.710
Then, that means we don't know anything about her?

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:20.230
Otoya-san might have known something but—

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.720
You mean he was done in too?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:31.480
The existence of the Akikan depends on the battle between aluminum and steel cans.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:35.400
This breaks the founding principles of Akikan Elect.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.680
That's why Otoya-san tried to stop her...

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.360
What did you say?!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.610
Najimi was hospitalized?!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:55.570
You bastard!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:59.610
Why were you hiding something so important from me?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.140
I wasn't hiding it!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.210
Ah, Kochikaze-san, where are you going?

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:08.240
Don't ask about something you should already know!

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:14.490
It wasn't just Airin-sensei, but even Tenkuuji-san...

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.780
Hey, what exactly happened?

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.770
It wasn't anything serious!

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:23.320
It was like, yeah! They were attacked by the Ghost of Wastefulness.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.260
Or something like that...

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.110
Anyway!

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:32.370
Najimi's injury wasn't serious.

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:34.000
She'll be able to leave soon.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.920
What about Yell-chan?

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.130
Yeah, ummm.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.790
Hey! She's basically Najimi's maid...

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.310
Right?

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:45.100
Hey, I heard there was a gas explosion near Tenkuuji-san's house.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.040
Scary.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.120
If someone was involved in that...

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.370
Explosions almost never happen!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.360
You never know...

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.370
You're okay?

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:27.390
Eh?

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:28.790
Yell?

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.530
What are you doing, suddenly attacking me?

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:37.240
Say something already! Yell!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.820
Cut it out already!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.090
Do you know what kind of situation you're in?

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.120
Najimi's hospitalized you know!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.920
I don't get it.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.190
Do you mean that I have to fight you?

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:00.580
I mean, you're an aluminum can, and you do piss me off,

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.720
but...

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.740
Just in time, huh?

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:15.990
Kakeru!

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.810
Don't go out wandering around by yourself during times like this!

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:19.920
You dented can!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.910
What? Who's a dented can?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:32.700
Budoko!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:34.760
Hey...

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.670
She's...

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.330
What should we do?

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.150
Isn't it obvious?

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.200
We beat the hell out of them!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.950
These impostors!

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.370
Eh?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.230
What are you saying?

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:57.830
These guys aren't the real Yell or Budoko.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:03.230
If she were the real Yell, she would go to where Najimi was no matter what.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.130
Yep.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.790
And Budoko!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.950
If you were the real Budoko, there's no way you'd have that!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:09.920
That slingshot!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.120
That's right!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.260
Misaki had that!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.450
And more than anything, these guys' eyes.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.110
These guys...

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:23.070
Their charm used to make someone like me go totally crazy over them!

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:27.010
And now they're as cold as if I'm some kind of garbage! It's so—

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.350
Ignoring your daydreams...

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:37.080
There seems to be no mistaking that these guys are impostors!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.380
Little brat, I'm over here!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.610
Now there's no way you can use your "Sour Grapes", right?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:49.380
Your opponent is me!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.270
Now I can see it clearly!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:16:00.130
When I compare you to the real Yell when she's fighting all out for Najimi...

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:02.170
You're nothing at all!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.140
Take that!

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:14.070
Melo-melo-melon!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.050
You did it, Melon!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:24.000
Yeah.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:26.770
Are you alright?

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:27.730
Yeah.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:29.700
If I drink some juice...

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:30.840
Hmm?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.360
Did you get a little fatter?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.580
Nevertheless, I'm surprised.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:40.840
Yeah?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.530
Why would they make clones of Yell and Budoko?

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.890
I'm talking about you.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:45.710
Huh?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:46.810
Me?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:52.210
Because you hate fighting and you always tell me not to fight but...

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:55.310
Well, that's, um...

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:58.410
Y-You were in danger... so I changed...

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:00.990
Ah, um, hey!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.940
I figured out that they were impostors right away, so...

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:08.490
If one's whole strength must be used, there's still a sense of justice or whatever you might call it.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.220
It's only natural that those feelings will come out.

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:15.810
I mean it's not anything in particular in your case, something like, something like, bursting forth—

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:16.390
Huh?

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:27.720
She's...

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:32.700
Mix, mix, mix 'er up...

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.170
Rainbow Splash Mixer!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.320
That's all you have, after all.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:55.900
Even though you defeated my Zero, it would be stupid to get cocky.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.390
Zero?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:17:59.840
You mean those impostors from before?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:06.040
They're dolls that I control using unnecessary calories from their hearts!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.340
Those are my Zeros!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.200
How dare you...

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.430
Your fate is the same as theirs.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.240
Budoko!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:18.240
Yell!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:22.390
Just like these guys, become my possession.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.560
What... the hell are you saying?!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.010
Melon!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.340
Sorry 'bout that.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:38.540
Can't expect much from an Akikan who depends on her owner.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:43.670
There's no way a plain old Akikan can compare to me!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.490
I'm the best!

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:49.020
Bari-bari-barrier!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.700
Melon!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.080
Are you her owner?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.710
That's right.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.240
I'm Melon's owner.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:17.850
You mean to say that she's important to you?

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:24.560
You must have had fun, frolicking around with your owner, huh?

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.870
Let her go.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.290
Let go of Melon!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.780
Of course.

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:32.210
After I finish what I need to do.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.260
What are you doing?

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.900
I'll tell you something nice.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.440
I'm a mixed juice Akikan.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.900
So that's why, I can do something like this.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.300
I got it!

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:22.160
This chick's powers as an Akikan.

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.780
I mixed it all in myself.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:31.030
Every time I mix an Akikan's power into myself, I become stronger!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.400
This is the power of mixed juice!

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.510
With this, it's the end for her.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:43.240
She won't ever be able to be loved again.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:44.640
Here.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.280
Melon?

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:55.750
Hey, Melon?

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.490
Say something already!

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:58.980
Don't stay silent!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.270
You dented can!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.130
You idiot!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.030
Selfish!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:06.080
Self-centered!

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.330
Fool!

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.480
Airhead!

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:09.670
Baseball freak!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.920
You flat-chested...

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:21.510
I returned it, as you asked.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.930
The empty shell, that is!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.380
I'm the best!

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:16.690
Kakeru...

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:19.710
Will I disappear like this?

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:21.560
Will I become trash?

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:23.180
No!

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.080
Save me!

